                                                "sense_id": "91beb873-6da1-3e84-90f0-395e44ceedd6",
                                                "text": "A scraper is a large scoop, mounted on pneumatic-tyre wheels, in which earth is collected by a steel cutting-blade at the front, and from which the earth is dumped wherever required. It is operated by the driver of the caterpillar tractor which hauls it."
